#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1665
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is set to erase this site's identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Babilim isch so igstellt, dass d Identität vo dere Website glöscht wird, wenn s Plugin glöscht wird. Die kostepflichtigi Lizenz vo dere Website chönnt danach nid automatisch wiederhärgstellt wärde; du müesstisch dr Babilim-Support unter %s kontaktiere. Um d Identität z bhalte, klick uf Abbräche, entfern s Häkli bi «Alli Babilim-Date bim Deinstalliere lösche» i de Einstellungen vo Babilim und deaktivier s Plugin nomal. Trotzdem deaktiviere?"

#. translators: 1: number of sites on the network that erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. 2: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1690
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in that site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgid_plural "%1$d sites on this network are set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to those sites could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in each site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr[0] "%1$d Website i dem Netzwerk isch so igstellt, dass ihri Babilim-Identität glöscht wird, wenn s Plugin glöscht wird. Die kostepflichtigi Lizenz vo dere Website chönnt danach nid automatisch wiederhärgstellt wärde; du müesstisch dr Babilim-Support unter %2$s kontaktiere. Um d Identität z bhalte, klick uf Abbräche, entfern s Häkli bi «Alli Babilim-Date bim Deinstalliere lösche» i de Babilim-Einstellungen vo dere Website und deaktivier s Plugin nomal. Trotzdem deaktiviere?"
msgstr[1] "%1$d Websites i dem Netzwerk sind so igstellt, dass ihri Babilim-Identität glöscht wird, wenn s Plugin glöscht wird. Die kostepflichtigi Lizenz vo dene Websites chönnt danach nid automatisch wiederhärgstellt wärde; du müesstisch dr Babilim-Support unter %2$s kontaktiere. Um d Identitäte z bhalte, klick uf Abbräche, entfern s Häkli bi «Alli Babilim-Date bim Deinstalliere lösche» i de Babilim-Einstellungen vo jeder Website und deaktivier s Plugin nomal. Trotzdem deaktiviere?"

#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1709
#, php-format
msgid "This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in each site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Dieses Netzwerk het z viel Websites, um sie eini nach dr angere z prüefe, und es paar devo sind möglecherwiis so igstellt, dass si ihri Babilim-Identität bim Lösche vom Plugin lösche. Die Kostepflichtigi Lizenz vo settige Websites chönnt de nid automatisch wiederhärgstellt wärde; du müesstisch dr Babilim-Support unter %s kontaktiere. Um d Identitäte z bhalte, drück uf Abbräche, entfern s Häkli bi «Alli Babilim-Date bim Deinstalliere lösche» i de Babilim-Einstellungen vo jeder Website und deaktivier nomal. Trotzdem deaktiviere?"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1798
